Switch: `linking.pitCopyKeepsOriginalPipeEnds` (ON). It stops a pit copy taking pipe ends already joined to a pit that still touches them.

The plan said only the new copy should hold back. I made every pit not already joined to the end hold back, because the earlier copy P11 would otherwise take P3's pipes on the second command.

